    "detailed_description": "<strong>Space Station Escape</strong> is a simple find-the-difference game.<br>Players take on the role of an astronaut wanting to escape from a spaceship running out of oxygen.<br><br>Don't overlook any anomalies.<br>If you find anomalies, turn left immediately.<br>If you don't find anomalies,  turn right immediately.<br><br><strong>Press SHIFT or RB to GO UP <br>Press CTRL or LB to GO DOWN</strong><br><br>To go out from Station.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> STORY </strong></h2><br>You are an astronaut stuck on a space station. The station's corridor is a loop with two turns, left and right.<br>You must quickly escape the corridor and choose the correct path before running out of reserve oxygen.<br>However, this corridor is an endless maze; if you encounter something unusual, turn left; if everything seems normal, turn right at the exit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> FEATURES </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience zero-gravity states in the spaceship.<br></li><li> Your oxygen will deplete quickly, and you will lose if you do not choose an exit path swiftly.<br></li><li> Simple, easy-to-control gameplay.<br></li><li> You can also respawn after running out of oxygen.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > WHAT AWAITS YOU BEYOND SPACE? </h2>Hurry and escape the dangerous corridor and wait for your team to rescue you before it's too late.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Space Station Escape</strong> is a simple find-the-difference game.<br>Players take on the role of an astronaut wanting to escape from a spaceship running out of oxygen.<br><br>Don't overlook any anomalies.<br>If you find anomalies, turn left immediately.<br>If you don't find anomalies,  turn right immediately.<br><br><strong>Press SHIFT or RB to GO UP <br>Press CTRL or LB to GO DOWN</strong><br><br>To go out from Station.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> STORY </strong></h2><br>You are an astronaut stuck on a space station. The station's corridor is a loop with two turns, left and right.<br>You must quickly escape the corridor and choose the correct path before running out of reserve oxygen.<br>However, this corridor is an endless maze; if you encounter something unusual, turn left; if everything seems normal, turn right at the exit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> FEATURES </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience zero-gravity states in the spaceship.<br></li><li> Your oxygen will deplete quickly, and you will lose if you do not choose an exit path swiftly.<br></li><li> Simple, easy-to-control gameplay.<br></li><li> You can also respawn after running out of oxygen.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > WHAT AWAITS YOU BEYOND SPACE? </h2>Hurry and escape the dangerous corridor and wait for your team to rescue you before it's too late.",
